# Phase 3: Layer 3 Empire Trajectory

## Overview
Build asset registry, compound dashboard, and staircase enforcer. Answers "where am I on the path to $50K/mo?" and blocks moves that don't advance the staircase.

## Requirements
- Functional: SQLite-backed asset registry, CLI for CRUD, weekly compound report, staircase state machine
- Non-functional: Single SQLite file. CLI-first. Reports as markdown.

## Architecture

```
asset-registry-cli.py ──→ assets.db (SQLite)
staircase-enforcer.py ──→ staircase-state.json
compound-dashboard.py ──→ data/empire/reports/compound-YYYY-MM-DD.md
```

### SQLite Schema

```sql
CREATE TABLE assets (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  name TEXT NOT NULL,
  category TEXT CHECK(category IN ('code','audience','data','relationship','revenue')),
  description TEXT,
  estimated_value_usd REAL DEFAULT 0,
  recurring_monthly_usd REAL DEFAULT 0,
  created_at TEXT DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  updated_at TEXT DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  metadata JSON
);

CREATE TABLE staircase_log (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  stair INTEGER CHECK(stair BETWEEN 0 AND 5),
  entered_at TEXT DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  monthly_revenue_usd REAL,
  notes TEXT
);

CREATE TABLE compound_snapshots (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  snapshot_date TEXT DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  total_assets INTEGER,
  total_value_usd REAL,
  total_mrr_usd REAL,
  compound_rate REAL,
  gap_to_target_usd REAL
);
```

### Staircase Definition

| Stair | MRR Range | Strategy | Allowed Opportunity Types |
|-------|-----------|----------|--------------------------|
| 0 | $0 | Validate | DOWNGRADE + PASS |
| 1 | $1-3K | Cash bridge | DOWNGRADE + PASS |
| 2 | $3-10K | Product revenue | PASS only |
| 3 | $10-30K | Scale | PASS only |
| 4 | $30-50K | Diversify | PASS only |
| 5 | $50-100K | Empire | PASS only |

